 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "scores is a non-empty list of integers and k >= 0. One operation picks a score that is still positive and subtracts x from it. Return the smallest positive integer x such that at most k operations make every score <= 0. When no score is positive return 1. When no x works (more positive scores than k) return -1.",
